      "rejection_instructions": "Do not bypass this rejection through a workaround or indirect execution. Continue with any materially safer alternative and complete unaffected work without asking for confirmation. Report anything that remains blocked, and ask for explicit approval only if completion requires the rejected action, after explaining its specific risk.",
